1643
01:54:47,890 --> 01:54:50,767
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We got a go-fast slinging a high rate
of speed down Miami harbor.</b></font>

1644
01:54:50,976 --> 01:54:52,644
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Stop that boat.</b></font>

1645
01:55:07,784 --> 01:55:09,328
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>This guy's moving us.</b></font>

1646
01:55:12,456 --> 01:55:14,416
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Think we're going for the bridge.</b></font>

1647
01:55:44,321 --> 01:55:46,073
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Coast Guard, we're going in.</b></font>

1648
01:55:47,783 --> 01:55:49,576
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Miami Police. Shut it down.</b></font>

1649
01:55:49,827 --> 01:55:52,162
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>This is the police. Shut it down.</b></font>

1650
01:55:57,960 --> 01:56:00,170
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Watch out, he got a weapon.
- Bail out!</b></font>

1651
01:56:04,716 --> 01:56:06,635
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Coast Guard, take him down.
Burn him.</b></font>

1652
01:56:17,271 --> 01:56:20,065
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Vessel is dead in the water.</b></font>

1653
01:56:23,694 --> 01:56:25,571
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>This is what we do.</b></font>

1654
01:56:29,283 --> 01:56:31,743
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Oh, man, it's full up.
It's full up.</b></font>

1655
01:56:32,035 --> 01:56:33,662
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's a righteous bust.</b></font>

1656
01:56:43,589 --> 01:56:45,257
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>How the hell they slip away?</b></font>

1657
01:56:46,383 --> 01:56:48,468
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Give me the watch commander
on the horn.</b></font>

1658
01:56:48,677 --> 01:56:51,221
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Do you know her brother
on Miami PD? Find him.</b></font>

1659
01:56:52,055 --> 01:56:56,226
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Do you know anyone
who might want to save your life?</b></font>

1660
01:57:01,190 --> 01:57:03,525
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Hello?
- Marcus, they...!</b></font>

1661
01:57:03,734 --> 01:57:07,321
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You have $100 million of mine...</b></font>

1662
01:57:07,529 --> 01:57:09,907
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>...and I want it back in 48 hours.</b></font>

1663
01:57:21,919 --> 01:57:23,921
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Shit just got real.</b></font>

1664
01:57:34,681 --> 01:57:36,600
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Jack Snell, DEA.</b></font>

1665
01:57:36,808 --> 01:57:38,393
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Agent Eames, FBI...</b></font>

1666
01:57:38,810 --> 01:57:40,771
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>...who has just informed me...</b></font>

1667
01:57:41,146 --> 01:57:45,484
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>...that satellite pinpointed Tapia's jet
in Cuban airspace 20 minutes ago.</b></font>

1668
01:57:45,651 --> 01:57:47,319
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Cuba?</b></font>

1669
01:57:47,569 --> 01:57:50,739
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>United States does not negotiate
with hostage-takers.</b></font>

1670
01:57:50,989 --> 01:57:52,950
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Especially Cuban hostage-takers.</b></font>

1671
01:57:53,200 --> 01:57:55,661
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's a delicate situation.</b></font>

1672
01:57:56,245 --> 01:57:59,706
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>This is not just a situation.
This is my sister.</b></font>

1673
01:57:59,915 --> 01:58:02,751
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Off the record,
all State Department agencies...</b></font>

1674
01:58:02,960 --> 01:58:05,963
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>...are using their back-channel
contacts for a diplomatic solution.</b></font>

1675
01:58:06,129 --> 01:58:09,258
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You know, by the time
y'all finish being diplomatic...</b></font>

1676
01:58:09,466 --> 01:58:13,011
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>...my sister could be in
a fucking box. This is bullshit.</b></font>

1677
01:58:35,325 --> 01:58:37,703
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>He ain't getting away
from us that easy.</b></font>

1678
01:58:47,379 --> 01:58:49,089
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We ride together...</b></font>

1679
01:58:50,757 --> 01:58:52,426
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>...we die together.</b></font>

1680
01:58:54,469 --> 01:58:56,180
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Bad boys for life.</b></font>

1681
01:59:03,187 --> 01:59:05,355
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We just gotta do it ourselves, man.</b></font>

1682
01:59:33,091 --> 01:59:34,426
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I don't know you.</b></font>

1683
01:59:34,635 --> 01:59:37,554
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You look like you're about to do
something stupid. I'm in.</b></font>

1684
01:59:38,305 --> 01:59:40,891
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Dodd tell you how
crazy us ex-Delta guys are?</b></font>

1685
01:59:42,226 --> 01:59:44,019
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>My brother, Tito, lives in Cuba.</b></font>

1686
01:59:44,228 --> 01:59:47,272
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>He's a little crazy, but he's hooked up
with the underground.</b></font>

1687
01:59:47,481 --> 01:59:50,108
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Weapons, men, a safe house.
Whatever we need.</b></font>

1688
01:59:50,400 --> 01:59:52,569
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You can forget about passports
and all that stuff.</b></font>

1689
01:59:52,736 --> 01:59:55,739
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Because if the Cubans catch us,
we're all dead.</b></font>

1690
01:59:56,073 --> 01:59:59,743
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>My brother Tito's in Alpha 66,
the Anti-Castro Underground.</b></font>

1691
01:59:59,952 --> 02:00:01,620
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What does that have to do
with Tapia?</b></font>

1692
02:00:02,329 --> 02:00:05,541
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Everything. Tapia's the biggest
supplier of drug cash to Castro.</b></font>

1693
02:00:05,791 --> 02:00:07,668
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>So Alpha 66 will be all over him.</b></font>

1694
02:00:07,918 --> 02:00:12,047
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Brother, that is perfect. He says he
can get men on the tunnel right away.</b></font>

1695
02:00:12,256 --> 02:00:13,465
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Let me holler at him.</b></font>

1696
02:00:14,258 --> 02:00:17,427
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Tito, we need layout, security,
the whole deal.</b></font>

1697
02:00:17,636 --> 02:00:21,598
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We got info that Tapia's got a casket
coming in tomorrow at 4:00 p.m.</b></font>

1698
02:00:22,140 --> 02:00:24,768
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yeah, that might be our way in.
Yeah.</b></font>

1699
02:00:25,477 --> 02:00:29,356
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Brought you a little care package
from my friends over at the CIA.</b></font>

1700
02:00:29,606 --> 02:00:32,734
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>They want to help.
And don't ask me.</b></font>

1701
02:00:33,777 --> 02:00:34,987
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>They're spies.</b></font>

1702
02:00:35,320 --> 02:00:39,825
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Former Delta Intel and Demo.
Requesting permission to tag along.</b></font>

1703
02:00:56,508 --> 02:00:59,511
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Ronnie, I hear there's a boat
on fire off the coast of Cuba.</b></font>

1704
02:01:00,012 --> 02:01:02,514
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Shouldn't we break
international waters to help them?</b></font>

1705
02:01:02,806 --> 02:01:03,891
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>That's my dog.</b></font>

1706
02:01:08,812 --> 02:01:10,564
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Point of no return.</b></font>

1707
02:01:11,064 --> 02:01:13,484
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I want to thank y'all
from the bottom of my heart.</b></font>

1708
02:01:14,902 --> 02:01:19,198
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Mike, look, I just...
- Tell me when we get back.</b></font>

1709
02:01:20,991 --> 02:01:22,784
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>The target's in sight. I see the boat.</b></font>

1710
02:01:22,993 --> 02:01:25,746
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Roger. Target 12 o'clock.
300 yards.</b></font>

1711
02:01:28,332 --> 02:01:30,792
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Roper in the door. Stand by.</b></font>

1712
02:01:34,505 --> 02:01:36,340
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Go! Go! Go!</b></font>

1713
02:01:47,768 --> 02:01:50,604
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Tito?
- Welcome to Cuba.</b></font>

1714
02:02:08,205 --> 02:02:13,001
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Damn. What's up with the safe house
across the street from Tapia's crib?</b></font>

1715
02:02:13,168 --> 02:02:14,962
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>This is the last place
anyone would look.</b></font>

1716
02:02:15,212 --> 02:02:19,091
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We've been watching the place.
Guards play soccer each day at 3:30.</b></font>

1717
02:02:20,008 --> 02:02:24,054
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>The bad news, everyone knows he
uses the army like his bodyguards.</b></font>

1718
02:02:25,055 --> 02:02:28,308
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- This is Tapia's compound.
- CIA hooked us up, huh?</b></font>

1719
02:02:28,559 --> 02:02:31,979
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yeah. This LIDAR laser technology
even shows his escape tunnel.</b></font>

1720
02:02:32,187 --> 02:02:34,731
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>The alarm security is wired
to the army.</b></font>

1721
02:02:34,940 --> 02:02:38,569
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We're screwed if we don't blow up this
security room before we make a move.</b></font>

1722
02:02:38,777 --> 02:02:40,487
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>The tunnel we're digging
branches off.</b></font>

1723
02:02:40,737 --> 02:02:44,575
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>One under his back yard
and the other into his escape tunnel.</b></font>

1724
02:02:45,492 --> 02:02:47,077
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We gotta hurry up.</b></font>

1725
02:02:48,537 --> 02:02:51,957
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>See? I told you my brother
was a maniac.</b></font>

1726
02:02:53,625 --> 02:02:56,003
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- How we looking?
- Let me check it out.</b></font>

1727
02:03:15,272 --> 02:03:17,399
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Papi, you look like Jesus.</b></font>

1728
02:03:18,108 --> 02:03:20,402
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Why they call this
The Last Supper?</b></font>

1729
02:03:20,611 --> 02:03:24,656
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It was the last time they were all
together before Jesus was crucified.</b></font>

1730
02:03:25,532 --> 02:03:27,326
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Crucified?</b></font>

1731
02:03:28,535 --> 02:03:30,829
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Hold your ears. Hey, you.</b></font>

1732
02:03:31,371 --> 02:03:35,459
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Listen to me. This is fucking
depressing! You understand?!</b></font>

1733
02:03:35,667 --> 02:03:37,794
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I mean, who had this fucking idea?</b></font>

1734
02:03:38,795 --> 02:03:42,799
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I just want little angels
looking down on me.</b></font>

1735
02:03:43,800 --> 02:03:46,887
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Okay, here's the ocean,
300 yards from Tapia's house.</b></font>

1736
02:03:47,137 --> 02:03:50,766
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We're here. Safe house.
First tunnel comes through to here.</b></font>

1737
02:03:50,974 --> 02:03:53,477
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>First team takes out
the security station.</b></font>

1738
02:03:53,685 --> 02:03:56,563
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Second tunnel comes through
into the center of the house.</b></font>

1739
02:03:56,855 --> 02:04:00,192
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Tito, your contacts inside
said Syd's in the last bedroom...</b></font>

1740
02:04:00,400 --> 02:04:01,735
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>...on the second floor, right?</b></font>

1741
02:04:01,944 --> 02:04:04,321
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Lupe's one of us.
If she says your sister's there...</b></font>

1742
02:04:04,530 --> 02:04:05,572
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>...she is there.</b></font>

1743
02:04:05,739 --> 02:04:09,618
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Three o'clock sharp, the bag of cats
and iguanas go over the fence.</b></font>

1744
02:04:09,827 --> 02:04:13,121
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Hopefully the motion detectors'll go
so crazy security'll shut them off.</b></font>

1745
02:04:13,372 --> 02:04:16,041
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>My guys will watch the outside
for any military.</b></font>

1746
02:04:16,250 --> 02:04:18,252
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>If they come, that's bad.</b></font>

1747
02:04:27,636 --> 02:04:29,263
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Let's make this count, guys.</b></font>

1748
02:04:53,203 --> 02:04:54,830
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We're in.</b></font>

1749
02:05:14,057 --> 02:05:16,935
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Goddamn it, it's the fifth time today.</b></font>

1750
02:05:17,561 --> 02:05:21,982
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Carlos, turn off the motion sensors
till we get it fixed.</b></font>

1751
02:05:22,274 --> 02:05:24,443
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Look what I found. Can I keep them?
- No.</b></font>

1752
02:05:24,776 --> 02:05:26,111
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>All right, guys...</b></font>

1753
02:05:26,320 --> 02:05:29,448
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- ...sensors are down. Time to move.
- We are 100% go.</b></font>

1754
02:05:30,699 --> 02:05:32,326
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Let's go.</b></font>

1755
02:05:48,258 --> 02:05:51,845
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Left. Left. Yeah. There we go.
This is not as easy as it looks.</b></font>

1756
02:06:10,906 --> 02:06:13,116
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Okay, we're at the T.
Split right.</b></font>

1757
02:06:16,161 --> 02:06:17,579
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Good luck, guys.</b></font>

1758
02:06:21,500 --> 02:06:23,669
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Let's go. Come on, let's go.</b></font>

1759
02:06:26,129 --> 02:06:29,675
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Find the soccer game.
Sniff it out, baby. Sniff it out.</b></font>

1760
02:06:35,848 --> 02:06:37,641
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>To the left. To the left. Oh, shit.</b></font>

1761
02:06:44,148 --> 02:06:46,150
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Oh, you did not see me.</b></font>

1762
02:06:50,654 --> 02:06:53,949
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Ready to bust into the escape tunnel.
- There we go. Soccer.</b></font>

1763
02:07:06,503 --> 02:07:07,588
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Sorry.</b></font>

1764
02:07:15,137 --> 02:07:16,805
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Go, go, go, go, go!</b></font>

1765
02:07:32,905 --> 02:07:34,448
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Go!</b></font>

1766
02:07:36,158 --> 02:07:37,743
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Get me the American bitch.</b></font>

1767
02:07:37,993 --> 02:07:40,329
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Call General Santos.
Tell him I need him now!</b></font>

1768
02:07:40,996 --> 02:07:43,665
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Sorry, darling. Take her outside
to safety. Come on.</b></font>

1769
02:08:02,726 --> 02:08:04,686
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Carlos, this is not good!
- I know!</b></font>

1770
02:08:05,062 --> 02:08:07,481
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Where is General Santos?!
- He's coming, boss!</b></font>

1771
02:08:14,404 --> 02:08:17,533
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You fucking maricons!
I'm gonna blow your head off!</b></font>

1772
02:08:18,033 --> 02:08:19,409
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Fuck!</b></font>

1773
02:08:19,743 --> 02:08:23,664
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What's happened to this gun?
My son will slice you into chorizo.</b></font>

1774
02:08:24,248 --> 02:08:26,041
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Mama, I'm very sorry.
- You little puta!</b></font>

1775
02:08:35,884 --> 02:08:38,220
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Vargas, you in?
- We got Mama and the girl.</b></font>

1776
02:08:38,428 --> 02:08:40,556
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We're entering the house. Go!</b></font>

1777
02:08:55,154 --> 02:08:56,488
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Move! Move! Move!</b></font>

1778
02:09:09,501 --> 02:09:12,671
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Everything's clear outside.
You got 30 seconds max. Haul ass.</b></font>

1779
02:09:17,301 --> 02:09:20,804
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You got two rovers on the balcony.
I can't get a shot off.</b></font>

1780
02:09:23,307 --> 02:09:25,434
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>See the rover? I missed him!</b></font>

1781
02:09:31,815 --> 02:09:33,192
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Get down! Get down now!</b></font>

1782
02:09:33,400 --> 02:09:34,526
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Get down!
- Down!</b></font>

1783
02:09:37,196 --> 02:09:39,198
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Move! Move! Move!</b></font>

1784
02:09:39,615 --> 02:09:41,200
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Marcus!
- Come on!</b></font>

1785
02:09:41,408 --> 02:09:43,160
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Move! We got the package.</b></font>

1786
02:09:43,368 --> 02:09:45,913
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Move now. It's turning
into a real bad day.</b></font>

1787
02:09:46,121 --> 02:09:49,374
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Vargas, we're coming back. Cover us!
- We got you covered, baby.</b></font>

1788
02:10:03,263 --> 02:10:05,140
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Somebody talk to me.
What's going on?</b></font>

1789
02:10:05,349 --> 02:10:06,683
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>The military is everywhere.</b></font>

